      "v": 1,
      "zh": "约旦河西，住山地、高原，并对着黎巴嫩山沿大海一带的诸王，就是赫人、亚摩利人、迦南人、比利洗人、希未人、耶布斯人的诸王，听见这事，",
      "en": "When the news reached all the kings on the west side of the Jordan[NOTE:1]—in the hill country, the foothills,[NOTE:2] and all along the Mediterranean coast[NOTE:3] as far as[NOTE:4] Lebanon (including the Hittites, Amorites, Canaanites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites)—",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “When all the kings who were beyond the Jordan heard.”",
